{"seq":99,"slug":"game-server-architecture","title":"游戏服务器架构","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture","rating":{"composite":4.06,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"游戏服务器架构\">游戏服务器架构</h1><p>游戏服务器是多人在线游戏的权威仲裁者——它拥有游戏世界的唯一真相，接收玩家输入、执行模拟、广播状态，并在毫秒级别完成这一切。从单局对战到百万人同时在线的 MMO，服务器架构决定了游戏能支撑多少玩家、延迟能压到多低、作弊能防到多严。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦<strong>服务器端架构设计</strong>：服务器模型选择（Dedicated / Listen / Hybrid）、Tick 循环的实现、集群扩缩容策略、会话与持久化层的设计、协议选型与带宽优化、以及部署运维与服务器端反作弊。核心视角始终站在&quot;后端如何支撑前端的实时体验&quot;这一命题上。</p>\n<p>与同 category 下两个兄弟 hub 的分工明确：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>game-networking-replication</strong> 侧重客户端同步技术——预测、插值、回滚、状态复制等&quot;让客户端看起来流畅&quot;的技术栈。本 hub 讨论这些技术在服务器端的对应实现（如 Tick 循环中何时广播快照），但不重复客户端预测的推导过程。</li>\n<li><strong>game-matchmaking-systems</strong> 侧重匹配算法与队列调度——Elo/Glicko 评分、技能分桶、队列公平性。本 hub 关注匹配完成后服务器实例如何被分配、启动和回收，但不涉及匹配算法本身。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>四个章节按服务器生命周期组织：基础模型（foundations）→ 基础设施层（infrastructure）→ 网络通信层（networking）→ 运维与安全（operations）。读者从第一章理解服务器是什么、如何工作，逐步深入到生产环境中真正面对的扩容、延迟与安全问题。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"服务器模型基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"server-models-overview","title":"游戏服务器模型总览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/foundations/server-models-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"authoritative-server","title":"权威服务器模型设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/foundations/authoritative-server"},{"seq":3,"slug":"server-tick-loop","title":"服务器 Tick 循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/foundations/server-tick-loop"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"infrastructure","title":"基础设施与扩缩容","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/infrastructure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"server-scaling-patterns","title":"服务器扩缩容模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/infrastructure/server-scaling-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"session-management","title":"会话管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/infrastructure/session-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"persistence-database","title":"持久化与数据库选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/infrastructure/persistence-database"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"networking","title":"网络协议与优化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/networking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"protocol-design","title":"网络协议设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/networking/protocol-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"latency-compensation","title":"延迟补偿（服务器端）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/networking/latency-compensation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bandwidth-optimization","title":"带宽优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/networking/bandwidth-optimization"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运维与安全","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"deployment-hotfix","title":"部署与热修复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/operations/deployment-hotfix"},{"seq":2,"slug":"monitoring-observability","title":"监控与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/operations/monitoring-observability"},{"seq":3,"slug":"anti-cheat-server-side","title":"服务器端反作弊","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/operations/anti-cheat-server-side"}]}]}